message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "The Intelligence Bound: Reference Computations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hart
    given-names: "Justin D."
    affiliation: "Viridis LLC, Columbia Falls, Montana, USA"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3082-2482"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jdhart81/viridis-llc-intelligence-bound"
abstract: "Reference computations and supplementary materials for \"The Intelligence Bound: Thermodynamic Limits on Learning Rate and Implications for Biosphere Information\" (Hart 2025). The code evaluates the conjectured bound min(D*B, P/(k_B T ln 2)) for illustrative inputs and reproduces the paper's tables; it does not test the bound against measured learning rates. The physical bound is a conjecture; its conditional mathematics is checked in Lean 4 in intelligence-bound-lean, where the thermodynamic arm is an assumed premise."
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - "Intelligence Bound"
  - "thermodynamics"
  - "information theory"
  - "Landauer principle"
  - "learning rate"
  - "biosphere"
